{"id":"xdcr8gx9bumxtd3p0ohhnhgnk","title":"浙江理工大学沈剑教授团队招聘博士后研究人员","originalTitle":null,"summary":"浙江理工大学沈剑教授团队招聘普通博士后和师资博士后，要求博士学位且年龄在35岁以下，具有网络空间安全、计算机科学与技术、密码学、人工智能等相关专业背景。团队提供有竞争力的薪酬和科研启动经费，并支持申报国家资助项目和职称评定，符合条件者可优先留校任教。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=425155&do=blog&id=1561868"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T03:51:15.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.747Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.747Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":23,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ab4a3cf1-e5f4-4638-98f6-79645649c75a","title":"浙江理工大学沈剑教授团队发布博士后招聘，要求35岁以下博士"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ab4a3cf1-e5f4-4638-98f6-79645649c75a","title":"浙江理工大学沈剑教授团队发布博士后招聘，要求35岁以下博士"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fdAy8ar3S08c","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}